WEBVTT

00:00:03.400 --> 00:00:04.410
Asuka-san...

00:00:05.640 --> 00:00:07.480
Is school fun?

00:00:09.480 --> 00:00:10.330
Yeah.

00:00:10.330 --> 00:00:11.630
I think it is.

00:00:13.440 --> 00:00:16.360
That's why I don't want
to be a Magical Girl anymore.

00:00:16.920 --> 00:00:20.540
I don't want to lose any more
of the people close to me.

00:00:35.160 --> 00:00:37.930
Now we have all the cards we need.

00:00:47.650 --> 00:00:50.110
I can't wait to see the movie.

00:00:49.490 --> 00:00:53.020
Not<i> fighting because
you have things you care about...</i>

00:00:53.020 --> 00:00:55.310
<i>You're supposed to do the
opposite, Asuka-san.</i>

00:02:49.560 --> 00:02:50.960
Francine!

00:02:51.980 --> 00:02:53.120
Francine!

00:02:53.120 --> 00:02:55.170
I'll bring Kurumi over right away!

00:02:55.170 --> 00:02:56.110
It's hopeless.

00:02:58.090 --> 00:03:00.690
There isn't time.

00:03:01.010 --> 00:03:02.490
Francine...

00:03:03.170 --> 00:03:07.200
Asuka, you must be our next leader.

00:03:07.200 --> 00:03:08.120
No!

00:03:08.120 --> 00:03:09.240
Don't die!

00:03:10.670 --> 00:03:13.250
Protect this world.

00:03:13.250 --> 00:03:15.380
It has a lot of problems,

00:03:15.610 --> 00:03:20.140
but lots of beautiful things, too.

00:03:23.650 --> 00:03:25.680
Things worth protecting...

00:03:26.210 --> 00:03:28.200
Things worth fighting for...

00:03:30.740 --> 00:03:33.280
I'm counting on you, Asuka.

00:03:52.050 --> 00:03:53.230
Francine...

00:03:59.890 --> 00:04:03.390
The things that make this
world worth protecting...

00:04:07.640 --> 00:04:11.350
<b>Iizuka-san</b>

00:04:07.640 --> 00:04:11.350
<b>Incoming Call</b>

00:04:08.920 --> 00:04:10.110
Iizuka-san?

00:04:11.350 --> 00:04:16.360
<b>Babel Brigade—Combat Begins</b>

00:04:19.570 --> 00:04:20.950
Nozomi...

00:04:20.950 --> 00:04:23.690
Were you really kidnapped?

00:04:24.790 --> 00:04:27.660
There's been no info from the JSDF.

00:04:30.420 --> 00:04:32.060
Makino-san...

00:04:32.060 --> 00:04:36.340
The Chief of Police received a message
and a photo from the East Asia United Front.

00:04:36.340 --> 00:04:37.500
What are their demands?

00:04:37.660 --> 00:04:39.250
No demands.

00:04:39.250 --> 00:04:42.190
They simply say they want revenge.

00:04:42.190 --> 00:04:46.300
Make Kim Kanth tell us where
they'd be likely to hide her.

00:04:46.300 --> 00:04:47.940
I'll let you do the interrogation.

00:04:49.090 --> 00:04:50.220
What will you do?

00:04:50.640 --> 00:04:56.060
I'm off to talk with Commissioner Miura
 about a rescue operation.

00:05:04.790 --> 00:05:06.790
It's grilling up great!

00:05:06.790 --> 00:05:09.030
Do you like grilled meat?

00:05:11.570 --> 00:05:13.420
I do!

00:05:13.420 --> 00:05:18.960
Charcoal really roasts the meat
with far-infrared radiation.

00:05:19.500 --> 00:05:21.920
I think it's about done.

00:05:24.070 --> 00:05:26.480
These scissors are so great.

00:05:26.900 --> 00:05:28.800
At first I was surprised.

00:05:29.300 --> 00:05:31.680
I didn't think you could
cut meat with scissors.

00:05:33.220 --> 00:05:36.060
They're really sharp.

00:05:37.250 --> 00:05:42.540
Then you just roast the leftover bones
on the coals until they're nice and crisp,

00:05:42.540 --> 00:05:45.150
and then eat the meat
around the bones.

00:05:45.150 --> 00:05:47.680
I love grilled meat.

00:05:49.070 --> 00:05:52.490
I hope you start to love it, too.

00:05:52.890 --> 00:05:56.460
Grilled... meat...

00:06:00.000 --> 00:06:01.950
Don't worry. Don't worry.

00:06:01.950 --> 00:06:04.540
I haven't turned the camera on yet.

00:06:04.540 --> 00:06:07.170
Now, let's eat.

00:06:07.170 --> 00:06:08.830
Or the meat's going to get burnt.

00:06:17.000 --> 00:06:20.200
Did they discover my identity
and go after her?

00:06:20.740 --> 00:06:22.010
No.

00:06:22.010 --> 00:06:24.370
This is retaliation for Kim Kanth.

00:06:24.370 --> 00:06:25.740
Retaliation?

00:06:25.740 --> 00:06:27.320
Why Nozomi?

00:06:27.320 --> 00:06:31.030
Her father works for the Public Safety
Department's Foreign Affairs Section.

00:06:31.950 --> 00:06:33.440
What are they doing
for a rescue operation?

00:06:33.930 --> 00:06:37.340
We made Kim tell us the
location of their base in the city.

00:06:37.340 --> 00:06:40.690
Public Safety is going
to send agents there.

00:06:40.690 --> 00:06:42.210
Or they were, at least.

00:06:44.420 --> 00:06:47.420
<b>Kasumigahara National Police Agency</b>

00:06:47.420 --> 00:06:48.830
"Stay out of this?"

00:06:48.830 --> 00:06:50.170
What do you mean?

00:06:50.340 --> 00:06:51.540
In the last battle,

00:06:51.540 --> 00:06:57.280
the East Asia United Front used a
Halloween-class Magic Biological Weapon.

00:06:58.170 --> 00:07:06.600
Kim Kanth's statements indicate
that it's likely they possess more.

00:07:06.600 --> 00:07:08.780
That was your report, right?

00:07:09.220 --> 00:07:12.910
Sending any amount of agents
up against a Magic Biological Weapon

00:07:12.910 --> 00:07:15.330
achieves nothing but the creation
of a pile of dead bodies.

00:07:15.330 --> 00:07:15.910
Then...

00:07:15.910 --> 00:07:21.280
But this is too small an incident
for us to go begging the JSDF

00:07:21.280 --> 00:07:23.380
to send in a magical warfare unit.

00:07:24.270 --> 00:07:26.440
So you're telling me to just let her die?

00:07:26.440 --> 00:07:28.040
We police are...

00:07:28.040 --> 00:07:28.910
Of course.

00:07:28.910 --> 00:07:31.590
The largest user of organized
violence in Japan.

00:07:31.590 --> 00:07:34.160
If we allow one of our own to be hurt,

00:07:34.160 --> 00:07:36.350
it's a challenge to the
authority of our badge.

00:07:36.530 --> 00:07:40.150
And a challenge to the
authority of Japan itself.

00:07:40.150 --> 00:07:41.630
Then why...

00:07:41.630 --> 00:07:43.160
If we sacrifice her,

00:07:43.160 --> 00:07:45.970
we can get a huge
budget to go after them.

00:07:47.810 --> 00:07:50.870
Your daughter will be a valuable sacrifice.

00:07:50.870 --> 00:07:53.440
Once they send us her body,

00:07:53.440 --> 00:07:56.820
we can make the 
East Asian United Front pay. Dearly.

00:08:00.250 --> 00:08:03.750
And that's the brass's decision?

00:08:06.470 --> 00:08:08.280
If a Magical Girl just showed up on her own,

00:08:08.280 --> 00:08:11.180
like what happened at Iidabashi,

00:08:11.180 --> 00:08:13.180
that would change things.

00:08:17.440 --> 00:08:19.980
Public Safety's not going to act?

00:08:20.680 --> 00:08:22.460
It seems they've come to the decision

00:08:22.460 --> 00:08:27.230
that they're no match for a
Magic Biological Weapon.

00:08:27.690 --> 00:08:29.410
Then what about Spec-Ops?

00:08:29.410 --> 00:08:31.530
What about M Squad?

00:08:31.530 --> 00:08:36.430
The JGSDF can only intervene when
a magical battle actually occurs.

00:08:36.430 --> 00:08:40.710
We can't go in without
a request from the police.

00:08:41.590 --> 00:08:44.160
Then no one can do anything.

00:08:44.510 --> 00:08:45.880
Since the war,

00:08:45.880 --> 00:08:49.220
things have been tense
between us and the police.

00:08:49.220 --> 00:08:53.130
And the police don't
like being in our debt.

00:08:54.560 --> 00:08:56.100
So they'll just let her die?

00:09:04.100 --> 00:09:05.890
Someone who can move quietly,

00:09:05.890 --> 00:09:09.720
and who can handle a 
Halloween-class if it shows up...

00:09:11.250 --> 00:09:13.120
A Magical Girl, right?

00:09:13.580 --> 00:09:15.820
Iizuka-san called me.

00:09:16.320 --> 00:09:17.710
I'll go, too.

00:09:17.710 --> 00:09:18.780
Me, too!

00:09:20.100 --> 00:09:21.090
Kurumi...

00:09:24.750 --> 00:09:26.990
Even if she's been horribly tortured,

00:09:26.990 --> 00:09:29.680
I can heal her right then and there.

00:09:29.680 --> 00:09:30.810
But...

00:09:30.810 --> 00:09:31.990
Are you sure?

00:09:31.990 --> 00:09:34.590
You're officially with the JSDF now.

00:09:34.920 --> 00:09:38.040
If I can't help you with
what you want to do,

00:09:38.040 --> 00:09:40.260
I'll gladly quit the JSDF.

00:09:42.930 --> 00:09:47.310
I'll send the information Kim Kanth
gave us to your cell, Asuka.

00:09:47.820 --> 00:09:48.810
Thanks.

00:09:49.580 --> 00:09:51.250
The one thing I can do

00:09:51.250 --> 00:09:54.130
is call the local police
and have the area sealed off.

00:09:54.130 --> 00:09:56.130
And if the battle gets intense,

00:09:56.130 --> 00:09:58.160
I can send in M Squad as reinforcements.

00:09:58.160 --> 00:09:58.820
No.

00:10:00.040 --> 00:10:01.580
We won't need reinforcements.

00:10:06.080 --> 00:10:08.660
Are you sure about this, Chief?

00:10:08.980 --> 00:10:12.660
We can't control what
the Magical Girls do.

00:10:12.660 --> 00:10:15.040
We'll do our job as adults.

00:10:15.040 --> 00:10:16.130
Then...

00:10:16.690 --> 00:10:19.080
Get loaded up with A-2
equipment and prepare to roll out.

00:10:19.080 --> 00:10:21.220
I'll explain the details soon.

00:10:21.620 --> 00:10:22.530
Roger!

00:10:23.740 --> 00:10:26.690
<i>My claws can cut through anything.</i>

00:10:27.620 --> 00:10:31.730
<i>You're going to find out what happens...</i>

00:10:37.840 --> 00:10:39.920
<i>When you do something
bad where I can reach you.</i>

00:10:52.410 --> 00:10:55.500
We're grateful to M Squad
for their quick report.

00:10:56.210 --> 00:11:00.240
If the Magical Girls are acting
of their own volition,

00:11:00.240 --> 00:11:01.520
then there's nothing we can do about it.

00:11:02.560 --> 00:11:07.100
We don't control them.

00:11:07.850 --> 00:11:11.100
<b>Yakiniku
Gyumaden</b>

00:11:11.100 --> 00:11:14.110
<b>Domestic Kalbi

00:11:21.910 --> 00:11:23.810
You look great!

00:11:51.920 --> 00:11:55.390
Make sure you don't kill her, okay, Povar?

00:11:55.690 --> 00:11:56.990
Abigail,

00:11:56.990 --> 00:11:59.470
when we kill her, Storozh will do it.

00:11:59.470 --> 00:12:02.360
We can't recycle her otherwise.

00:12:03.860 --> 00:12:07.440
But we need to make
her suffer a bit more,

00:12:07.440 --> 00:12:11.010
or the guys from the EAUF
won't be satisfied.

00:12:12.910 --> 00:12:15.110
Let me handle the rest.

00:12:23.430 --> 00:12:28.210
Russian legends say that the
souls of young women who drown

00:12:28.210 --> 00:12:31.140
become spirits known as rusalka.

00:12:35.540 --> 00:12:37.450
Don't hurt me...

00:12:37.450 --> 00:12:41.890
The rusalka was just an old legend.

00:12:41.890 --> 00:12:43.160
But...

00:12:43.330 --> 00:12:45.780
Please... stop...

00:12:51.910 --> 00:12:58.880
The magic of the spirits has revived
the rusalka in the modern era.

00:13:05.790 --> 00:13:11.250
Masters of the rusalka can
command water to do as they will.

00:13:11.250 --> 00:13:13.780
I am the watcher at the waterside.

00:13:13.780 --> 00:13:17.730
That is why they call me Storozh, "Watchman."

00:13:17.730 --> 00:13:19.580
And I am Povar.

00:13:20.090 --> 00:13:22.190
"Chef."

00:13:22.450 --> 00:13:25.150
As for why they call me a chef...

00:13:26.930 --> 00:13:29.740
You'll find out later.

00:13:30.330 --> 00:13:32.200
No, stop...

00:13:32.740 --> 00:13:34.100
Don't hurt me!

00:13:34.100 --> 00:13:35.300
I don't know anything!

00:13:35.300 --> 00:13:36.350
I'll do anything!

00:13:36.350 --> 00:13:37.800
So please...

00:13:37.800 --> 00:13:39.660
Stop it!

00:13:40.210 --> 00:13:43.080
You don't need to do anything.

00:13:44.910 --> 00:13:49.090
Did you know your dad worked
for Public Safety?

00:13:49.850 --> 00:13:51.550
Public Safety?

00:13:51.550 --> 00:13:55.940
We're going to send a video
of you being tortured to Public Safety

00:13:55.940 --> 00:13:57.080
and set a trap.

00:13:57.940 --> 00:14:02.250
They'll analyze the
video to find this place,

00:14:02.250 --> 00:14:05.970
and send in Magical Girls like they did at

00:14:05.970 --> 00:14:07.830
Iidabashi and Shinjuku 3rd Avenue.

00:14:08.210 --> 00:14:10.960
Magical Girls?

00:14:10.960 --> 00:14:12.190
Yes.

00:14:12.190 --> 00:14:15.290
Magical Girls, defenders of love and justice.

00:14:16.950 --> 00:14:21.220
They're worried about 
Magic Biological Weapons.

00:14:21.220 --> 00:14:24.880
But they don't know that we have
sorcerer mercenaries from Russia.

00:14:25.150 --> 00:14:27.390
We can ambush them.

00:14:28.240 --> 00:14:29.980
Anyway, get back to it.

00:14:30.380 --> 00:14:33.660
But this time make sure
you're not on the video.

00:14:33.660 --> 00:14:36.100
I don't want them to know
what we've got planned.

00:14:36.570 --> 00:14:37.980
That will be more difficult.

00:14:37.980 --> 00:14:38.810
Yes.

00:14:39.050 --> 00:14:40.520
Please,

00:14:40.520 --> 00:14:42.210
stop...

00:14:51.430 --> 00:14:53.240
Well done!

00:14:53.760 --> 00:14:57.480
Hey, I've been wondering...

00:14:57.480 --> 00:14:58.590
What?

00:14:58.590 --> 00:15:03.250
What do you gain from 
capturing a Magical Girl alive?

00:15:05.960 --> 00:15:11.400
The development of a Girl of Mass Destruction!

00:15:13.330 --> 00:15:16.600
It's all part of the queen's plan.

00:15:18.380 --> 00:15:19.400
Well,

00:15:19.400 --> 00:15:21.620
as long as we're paid,

00:15:21.620 --> 00:15:23.070
we don't care.

00:15:38.750 --> 00:15:40.010
<i>Gobu.</i>

00:15:43.770 --> 00:15:45.010
I see.

00:15:45.010 --> 00:15:46.510
Got it.

00:15:47.090 --> 00:15:50.520
You were a lot faster than I thought you'd be,

00:15:50.930 --> 00:15:52.940
Magical Girls...

00:16:02.240 --> 00:16:03.020
Acid.

00:16:03.020 --> 00:16:03.850
Roger.

00:16:09.090 --> 00:16:12.110
<i>The local police have sealed off the block.</i>

00:16:12.110 --> 00:16:13.980
<i>The citizens have been evacuated.</i>

00:16:13.980 --> 00:16:15.430
<i>Give 'em hell.</i>

00:16:15.430 --> 00:16:16.280
Roger.

00:16:21.550 --> 00:16:22.320
A trap.

00:16:22.320 --> 00:16:24.080
Sensors?

00:16:24.080 --> 00:16:26.430
A primitive wire trap.

00:16:26.430 --> 00:16:27.250
Sacchuu.

00:16:27.250 --> 00:16:28.800
Sacchuu!

00:16:32.590 --> 00:16:35.150
It's been a while since we've done this.

00:16:36.110 --> 00:16:39.760
Indoors CQC was Mia's specialty, right?

00:16:41.130 --> 00:16:43.900
Just like it was mine.

00:16:55.420 --> 00:16:56.160
Kurumi...

00:16:56.160 --> 00:16:57.120
Right!

00:16:57.800 --> 00:16:59.570
Magical Truth Serum!

00:17:05.400 --> 00:17:07.910
Magical Girl Trivia!

00:17:07.910 --> 00:17:09.460
Magical Truth Serum is

00:17:09.460 --> 00:17:13.820
a magically-enhanced
barbiturate truth serum, chu!

00:17:13.820 --> 00:17:16.050
It clouds the subject's mind

00:17:16.050 --> 00:17:19.470
and makes them tell you what
you need to know, chu!

00:17:21.770 --> 00:17:25.260
You're a terrorist from the
 East Asia United Front, right?

00:17:25.260 --> 00:17:26.890
Y-Yes.

00:17:27.390 --> 00:17:29.140
Where is the hostage?

00:17:29.140 --> 00:17:30.480
The basement.

00:17:30.480 --> 00:17:33.740
They're filming a torture video.

00:17:33.740 --> 00:17:35.170
How many are with you?

00:17:35.670 --> 00:17:37.100
Ten.

00:17:37.100 --> 00:17:39.290
Do any of them use magic?

00:17:39.290 --> 00:17:40.820
Three...

00:17:41.580 --> 00:17:44.950
Storozh, Povar,

00:17:44.950 --> 00:17:47.570
and Abigail.

00:17:50.230 --> 00:17:52.670
They never stay awake long.

00:17:52.670 --> 00:17:54.300
I'm sorry.

00:17:54.300 --> 00:17:57.270
It's difficult to fine-tune magical drugs.

00:17:58.360 --> 00:17:59.840
Let's hurry to the basement.

00:18:00.620 --> 00:18:01.460
Yes.

00:18:06.470 --> 00:18:07.600
They're here!

00:18:28.580 --> 00:18:30.360
Help me...

00:18:31.600 --> 00:18:32.850
Nozomi!

00:18:32.850 --> 00:18:34.340
How could they do this!

00:18:34.490 --> 00:18:36.430
Thanks for coming!

00:18:36.430 --> 00:18:37.790
Glad to have you.

00:18:37.790 --> 00:18:38.850
Rapture...

00:18:38.850 --> 00:18:40.100
War Nurse.

00:18:40.100 --> 00:18:43.060
Why did you kidnap that girl?

00:18:43.060 --> 00:18:45.220
She's just bait.

00:18:45.630 --> 00:18:48.600
Bait to lure you out.

00:18:48.600 --> 00:18:51.080
A good little Magical Girl

00:18:51.080 --> 00:18:54.030
couldn't leave a hostage behind, right?

00:18:54.820 --> 00:18:59.980
So this is some elaborate suicide
attempt on your part, then?

00:19:01.510 --> 00:19:02.870
That's funny!

00:19:02.870 --> 00:19:04.820
You're not worried at all, huh?

00:19:04.820 --> 00:19:06.510
Wait!

00:19:06.510 --> 00:19:09.440
What do you mean,
you wanted to lure us out?

00:19:09.440 --> 00:19:11.880
It's all for my queen.

00:19:12.710 --> 00:19:14.250
Your queen?

00:19:14.590 --> 00:19:19.130
I want your help with 
achieving my queen's ambition.

00:19:19.130 --> 00:19:21.400
If you just come with me,

00:19:21.400 --> 00:19:23.600
I'll let the hostage go.

00:19:23.920 --> 00:19:25.060
Shut up.

00:19:25.670 --> 00:19:27.020
That's right!

00:19:27.020 --> 00:19:27.940
We can't do that.

00:19:27.940 --> 00:19:29.210
So...

00:19:29.210 --> 00:19:32.320
Will you kill us, then,

00:19:32.320 --> 00:19:34.460
and just write her off
as collateral damage?

00:19:35.720 --> 00:19:38.130
Let the hostage go.

00:19:38.130 --> 00:19:40.450
Do it now, and I won't kill you.

00:19:40.450 --> 00:19:41.680
Oh, wow!

00:19:41.680 --> 00:19:43.520
That's so nice of you!

00:19:43.520 --> 00:19:44.570
Okay!

00:19:44.570 --> 00:19:45.870
I'll let her go!

00:19:53.760 --> 00:19:55.250
Oops!

00:19:55.250 --> 00:19:58.590
I meant to cut the chain, but I missed!

00:19:58.760 --> 00:20:00.050
You bitch!

00:20:00.280 --> 00:20:02.160
Throw down your weapons now.

00:20:02.160 --> 00:20:04.260
This time, I'll kill her for real.

00:20:58.050 --> 00:20:59.160
Damn it...

00:20:59.570 --> 00:21:00.600
Damn it!

00:21:00.600 --> 00:21:02.740
Fuck you! Fuck you! Fuck you!

00:21:02.740 --> 00:21:04.080
You'll pay for this!

00:21:04.080 --> 00:21:07.030
Rapture! War Nurse!

00:21:07.340 --> 00:21:10.080
Take Nozomi and get out of here.

00:21:10.610 --> 00:21:13.170
There's no way that
was enough to kill them.

00:21:13.170 --> 00:21:14.850
I'll buy time.

00:21:14.850 --> 00:21:15.630
Okay!

00:21:27.980 --> 00:21:30.170
<i>He blocked my karambit!</i>

00:21:32.460 --> 00:21:37.240
This ax was forged by the Eternal Ironworks'
 Magic Blacksmith, Ilmarinen.

00:21:37.240 --> 00:21:39.900
It's a match for even
a Magical Girl's weapon.

00:21:40.360 --> 00:21:44.240
Where'd you find an antique like that?

00:21:48.700 --> 00:21:51.100
I'll follow War Nurse.

00:21:51.100 --> 00:21:53.670
You two handle Rapture.

00:21:53.670 --> 00:21:54.660
Roger.

00:21:58.840 --> 00:22:00.280
I won't let you!

00:22:05.260 --> 00:22:07.840
<i>The way he's breathing, is that...</i>

00:22:08.620 --> 00:22:12.340
<i>Systema? The martial arts used
by Russian special forces?</i>

00:22:12.900 --> 00:22:18.270
He's using the power of a dead spirit
and human martial arts together, chu!

00:22:18.450 --> 00:22:20.730
Zloy dukh Systema.

00:22:24.730 --> 00:22:28.700
We need to work hard enough
to justify our salaries.

00:22:28.700 --> 00:22:31.870
Let's play, Magical Girl.

00:24:12.370 --> 00:24:16.100
Urban warfare against magic mercenaries
and a JSDF Spec-Ops group!

00:24:16.100 --> 00:24:19.060
Things just keep getting
crazier and crazier, chu!

00:24:19.060 --> 00:24:21.910
Next time, "A Very Realistic Way
 of Dealing with a Problem."

00:24:19.350 --> 00:24:23.600
<b>A Very Realistic Way of Dealing with a Problem</b>

00:24:21.910 --> 00:24:23.840
Time for Sacchuu to join the fight!

00:24:23.840 --> 00:24:26.620
Let me get my magical
brass knuckles, chu!
